 "state_rules": [
  "Exactly one tile is 'sel'. Selection is colour + translate, no texture change.",
  "sel: face, icon and label take the sel colours; the lift joint translates by offset [-6.25, -5.0] (unsheared; = (-5, -5) on screen); the plate appears at rest in gold_dk.",
  "Colour tokens resolve per tile: on the main menu every tile takes the colours of the section it leads to; elsewhere the screen's section.",
  "The description strip (chrome) shows the selected tile's desc."
 ],
